// The AI's economy (WP9.1b-2, docs/rules/ai.md, "The economy"): player 0 (Meridian) is the AI with a
// construction centre and 4000 credits on the first match's map (`assets/maps/m1`); player 1 (Veyran) is a lone
// static construction centre. Its profile (`ai_economy_defs/normal.ron`, a frozen copy of the profile of
// `ai_base_defs` with a goal list of four: power plant, refinery, barracks, vehicle factory) is short on purpose,
// so the economy turn is what acts for most of the 12,000 ticks: it buys a harvester when the vehicle factory
// stands (tick 2000), builds one ore silo when the store has been 90 percent full for two economy turns after
// the goal list is done (tick 6610), and replaces a lost harvester.
//
// The ore is richer than the shipped one (160 per cell, regrowth 8 per 40 ticks) so that the harvesters never run
// dry. Everything else (harvest, storage, money, production, power, vision) is `ai_base`'s, written out.
//
// The script, by entity id (slots are handed out in the order things appear: 0 the AI's centre, 1 player 1's
// centre, 2 the first power plant, 3 the refinery, 4 the harvester that comes free with the refinery):
//   tick 8001   Despawn Id(4, 0): that free harvester is lost. The AI orders a replacement at its next economy
//               turn (tick 8040; tools/sf_headless/tests/ai_economy.rs checks the tick and that only one is ordered).
// `unit_defs` names the FROZEN copy `ai_economy_defs`, so editing the shipped definitions or profile never moves
// this checksum or the AI digest.
Scenario(
    name: "ai_economy",
    seed: 0xA1_BA5E,
    map: (width: 96, height: 96),
    map_name: Some("m1"),
    unit_defs: Some("ai_economy_defs"),
    match_file: Some("match.ron"),
    ai: [(player: 0, profile: "normal.ron", seed: 0xA1_0001)],
    buildings: true,
    combat: true,
    targeting: true,
    destruction: true,
    ore: Some((start: 160, max: 160, regrow_amount: 8, regrow_period: 40)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
        call_timeout: 10,
        max_tries: 3,
        park_distance: 4,
        park_spread: 5,
        park_near_tenths: 20,
        mine_start_tenths: 10,
        mine_reach_tenths: 15,
        mine_lose_tenths: 25,
        dock_reach_tenths: 20,
        travel_cost: 16,
        queue_cost: 100,
        switch_margin: 100,
        recheck_period: 20,
        queue_gap: 3,
        queue_start: 1,
        queue_step: 2,
        queue_rows: 8,
    )),
    storage: Some([(2, 2000), (43, 1500)]),
    money: Some((credits_per_ore: 1)),
    production: Some((queue_limit: 5, exit_radius: 4, build_speed: (3, 2))),
    power: Some((shortage_floor_permille: 250, defence_cutoff_permille: 1000)),
    vision: Some((legacy_sight_milli: 5000, acquire_needs_sight: true)),
    ticks: 12000,
    commands: [
        (tick: 8001, player: 1, command: Despawn(ids: [Id(4, 0)])),
    ],
)
